  "description": "Nobody paid much attention to John – just a normal teenager at a high school where the social elite happened to possess unthinkable powers and abilities. But John’s got a secret past that threatens to bring down the school’s whole social order – and much more. Fulfilling his destiny won’t be easy, though, because there are battles, frenemies, and deadly conspiracies around every corner.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.webtoons.com/en/super-hero/unordinary/list?title_no=679)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/FANTASY/unordinary/list?title_no=1847), [German](https://www.webtoons.com/de/ACTION/unordinary/list?title_no=2602), [Spanish](https://www.webtoons.com/es/SUPER_HERO/unordinary/list?title_no=1914), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/ACTION/unordinary/list?title_no=1858), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0000367), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/fantasy/unordinary/list?title_no=6970)    \nKorean: [Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=839583), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12680464)",
